WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:10.323
An announcement came over the radio.

2
00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:13.444
"Taekuk crew, you are now free to move around."

3
00:00:13.464 --> 00:00:16.044
"Yippee!" shouted Jinwook.

4
00:00:16.064 --> 00:00:19.005
"Jinwook! Stop fooling around!

5
00:00:19.265 --> 00:00:20.566
We have lots of work to do!"

6
00:00:20.886 --> 00:00:22.346
Captain Peter scolded.

7
00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:25.567
But this was Jinwook's first time in space.

8
00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:27.828
He was too excited to work.

9
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:36.682
"Now that we're in space, you can take your pressure suit off," Linda said with a smile.

10
00:00:37.623 --> 00:00:39.283
Jinwook could not believe it!

11
00:00:39.704 --> 00:00:41.945
It was his dream to travel in space.

12
00:00:42.525 --> 00:00:45.446
He was about to begin his space adventure!

13
00:00:49.568 --> 00:00:52.769
Jinwook and the crew worked hard for several hours.

14
00:00:53.589 --> 00:00:56.711
Soon it was time for Jinwook's first meal in space.

15
00:00:56.731 --> 00:01:00.092
"It's not easy to eat in space.

16
00:01:00.892 --> 00:01:03.833
Eating in space takes practice," Adam said.

17
00:01:03.853 --> 00:01:05.234
"What do we eat?"

18
00:01:05.654 --> 00:01:06.574
Jinwook asked.

19
00:01:09.416 --> 00:01:15.098
"We can eat just about anything, but the food has to be made into a sticky paste," answered

20
00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:16.018
Captain Peter.

21
00:01:16.639 --> 00:01:18.019
Dinner was spaghetti!

22
00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:21.761
Mealtime in space is often playtime.

23
00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:25.022
Adam's favorite trick is playing with his drinks.

24
00:01:25.742 --> 00:01:29.284
In space, water floats in the air in big drops.

25
00:01:31.188 --> 00:01:32.169
"What's this for?"

26
00:01:32.629 --> 00:01:35.451
Jinwook pointed to the Velcro on his trousers.

27
00:01:35.471 --> 00:01:37.252
"That's Velcro.

28
00:01:37.612 --> 00:01:41.494
If we don't hold onto things, everything just floats around in space.

29
00:01:42.094 --> 00:01:45.656
So we use Velcro to hold things down," Adam explained.

30
00:01:46.237 --> 00:01:48.878
"Even this food tray has Velcro strips underneath.

31
00:01:49.318 --> 00:01:50.739
It can be attached to the wall!

32
00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:57.343
Watch!" "Do we float because there is no gravity in space?"

33
00:01:57.783 --> 00:01:58.664
Jinwook asked.

34
00:01:59.156 --> 00:02:02.859
"Gravity? Of course there's gravity," answered Adam.

35
00:02:02.879 --> 00:02:10.745
"But in orbit around Earth, there is very little gravity— almost zero—and you don't feel any weight.

36
00:02:11.306 --> 00:02:13.127
That's why it's so easy to move.

37
00:02:13.848 --> 00:02:15.589
That's why you can float in space.

38
00:02:17.771 --> 00:02:19.913
Look at Captain Peter," said Adam.

39
00:02:21.654 --> 00:02:23.676
"He's running on the exercise machine.

40
00:02:24.496 --> 00:02:28.880
Floating inside the space shuttle, we hardly use our bones and muscles at all.

41
00:02:29.428 --> 00:02:35.330
So to stay healthy, we have to exercise every day," he explained to Jinwook.

42
00:02:37.231 --> 00:02:39.492
"It's bedtime," Captain Peter said.

43
00:02:40.172 --> 00:02:42.253
Adam gave Jinwook a sleeping bag.

44
00:02:42.793 --> 00:02:45.074
"Make sure you attach your sleeping bag to something."

45
00:02:45.755 --> 00:02:48.916
Jinwook nodded, but he was too excited to sleep.

46
00:02:51.897 --> 00:02:54.358
Jinwook stayed up and looked out into space.

47
00:02:54.378 --> 00:02:58.560
"It's so amazing to be in space," he said to himself.

48
00:02:59.208 --> 00:03:02.170
Finally, Jinwook fell into a deep sleep.

49
00:03:04.612 --> 00:03:06.873
Jinwook was having a wonderful dream.

50
00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:11.196
He was telling his family and friends about his space adventure.

51
00:03:11.216 --> 00:03:13.738
"Ouch!" he cried suddenly.

52
00:03:13.758 --> 00:03:18.901
"Jinwook! I told you to attach your sleeping bag to something," said Captain Peter.

53
00:03:18.921 --> 00:03:21.423
"Wake up, Jinwook!

54
00:03:21.943 --> 00:03:25.886
Jinwook!" "Wake up, Jinwook!"

55
00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:27.667
his mom was saying.

56
00:03:27.687 --> 00:03:30.877
"Captain?" Jinwook called out sleepily.

57
00:03:30.897 --> 00:03:34.638
"Captain? It's Mom, Jinwook!

58
00:03:34.898 --> 00:03:36.339
You're late for school!"

59
00:03:36.359 --> 00:03:42.882
"School? There's no school aboard a spaceship," said Jinwook, waking up.

60
00:03:44.362 --> 00:03:48.284
"Spaceship? You must have been dreaming."

61
00:03:48.764 --> 00:03:49.845
His mother laughed.

62
00:03:50.785 --> 00:03:52.446
Jinwook picked up his book.

63
00:03:52.466 --> 00:03:57.108
"What happened to Captain Peter and Linda and Adam?

64
00:03:57.984 --> 00:03:59.605
Where are my Velcro trousers?"

65
00:04:00.405 --> 00:04:02.185
Jinwook spread his arms out.

66
00:04:02.205 --> 00:04:08.507
"Last night I had my first space adventure," he said excitedly.

67
00:04:08.527 --> 00:04:11.808
"Do you know what I want to be when I grow up?"

68
00:04:12.768 --> 00:04:14.789
"Let me guess—an astronaut?"

69
00:04:15.249 --> 00:04:16.309
His mother winked.
